{"seq":1,"slug":"component-availability-substitute","title":"组件可售性、缺货与替代","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dynamic-bundle-kit-commerce/bundle-inventory-price/component-availability-substitute","wordCount":1930,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"组件可售性-缺货与替代\">组件可售性、缺货与替代</h1><p>单品库存问「这件货还有多少」，组合库存问「这些货能不能同时凑齐」。后者不是前者的简单聚合：一个要 2 件 A 与 1 件 B 的组合，在 A 有 10 件、B 有 0 件时可售数必须是 0，而在 A 有 7 件、B 有 3 件时是 3。这个取值为最小值的直觉在加入可选槽位、多数量与替代品后立刻不再平凡——工业界的产品模型印证了这一点：Magento 的 bundle 在父级上不暴露可编辑的库存数量，其是否可售完全由组件推导，并且规定「全部选项可选且所有关联商品缺货」或「任一必选选项的关联商品缺货」时父级转为 Out of Stock（见 <a href=\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/docs/commerce-admin/catalog/products/types/product-create-bundle\">Adobe Commerce bundle products</a>）。本篇给出可售性合成的判定顺序、替代降级的边界，以及一条不该被忽略的约束：合成结果必须与下单时的实际预留严格一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>给定一个组合定义与一组组件的可用量，组合的可售数量按以下顺序判定：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>必选槽位</strong>：每个必选槽位的可满足量是该槽位所有候选可用量之和，组合上限取其最小值。</li>\n<li><strong>数量约束</strong>：若槽位要求选 2 件，可满足量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mtext>可用量</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor \\text{可用量} / 2 \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可用量</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>可选槽位</strong>：不构成可售性上限，但影响展示与价格（无货则隐藏该选项而非下架组合）。</li>\n<li><strong>替代降级</strong>：若槽位有替代组，可满足量为该组内所有可行组合的最大值。</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[组合定义 + 组件可用量] --&gt; B[逐个必选槽位求可满足量]&#10;  B --&gt; C{槽位是否为多件}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[可用量整除需求量后取下界]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[直接取候选可用量之和]&#10;  D --&gt; F[组合上限 = 各必选槽位最小值]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{是否有替代组}&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H[输出可售数量]&#10;  G --&gt;|是| I[枚举替代组合取最大可售数]&#10;  I --&gt; H\">graph TD\n  A[组合定义 + 组件可用量] --&gt; B[逐个必选槽位求可满足量]\n  B --&gt; C{槽位是否为多件}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[可用量整除需求量后取下界]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[直接取候选可用量之和]\n  D --&gt; F[组合上限 = 各必选槽位最小值]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{是否有替代组}\n  G --&gt;|否| H[输出可售数量]\n  G --&gt;|是| I[枚举替代组合取最大可售数]\n  I --&gt; H</pre><h3 id=\"最小值的直觉与陷阱\">最小值的直觉与陷阱</h3><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>required slots</mtext></mrow></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{bundle} = \\min_{s \\in \\text{required slots}} \\left\\lfloor \\frac{\\sum_{c \\in s} avail(c)}{demand(s)} \\right\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">required slots</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0796em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">man</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5546em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0636em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1786em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3494em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>这里最容易错的是把「候选可用量之和」写成「单一候选可用量」。动态捆绑的槽位允许多个候选，只要其中任一有货该槽位就可满足，因此要求和而不是取最大值。反过来，若槽位内候选是<strong>互斥替代</strong>（只能选其中一个且不共享库存），求和仍然正确，因为买家最终只会选一个。</p>\n<p>真正会算错的是<strong>共享组件</strong>：两个槽位都能选同一个 SKU 时，求和会重复计数。若该 SKU 有 3 件，两个槽位各算 3，整体给出 3，但实际每个组合要消耗 2 件，正确答案是 1。这正是 <a href=\"fixed-dynamic-gift-bundle-type\">固定套装、动态捆绑、买赠与搭配</a> 里强调必须用 <code>exclusiveWith</code> 显式建模跨槽互斥的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"替代降级的边界条件\">替代降级的边界条件</h2><p>替代（substitution）让组合在某个组件缺货时仍能售卖，是跨境组合最实用的手段——跨境补货周期长，任何一个组件断货都会让整组合下架。但替代有严格边界，越界会带来客诉与退货。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>替代类型</th>\n<th>允许场景</th>\n<th>禁止场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同款不同色</td>\n<td>组合未在商详承诺具体颜色</td>\n<td>商详明确写了「黑色」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同规格不同品牌</td>\n<td>组合描述为通用品类</td>\n<td>品牌是购买决策要素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同品牌升级款</td>\n<td>明确标注「免费升级」</td>\n<td>未告知即替换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容量/尺寸差异</td>\n<td>差异在组合描述范围内</td>\n<td>影响兼容性或适配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"降级的实现与告知\">降级的实现与告知</h3><p>替代降级的实现要点是<strong>在可售性查询阶段就完成替换，并把替换结果写进订单行</strong>，而不是到拣货时才决定。原因是价格分摊、报关申报都依赖具体的组件 SKU；若拣货时才替换，退款基数与申报要素都要事后追改。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 可售性查询：带替代组，返回实际会选择的具体组件&#10;WITH slot_avail AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    slot_id,&#10;    COALESCE(substitute_group, slot_id) AS grp,&#10;    SUM(available_qty) AS avail&#10;  FROM inventory_available i&#10;  JOIN bundle_slot_candidate c ON c.component_sku = i.sku&#10;  WHERE c.bundle_sku = :bundleSku AND c.version = :ver&#10;  GROUP BY 1, 2&#10;)&#10;SELECT MIN(FLOOR(avail / demand_qty)) AS bundle_available&#10;FROM slot_avail JOIN bundle_slot s USING (slot_id)&#10;WHERE s.required;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 可售性查询：带替代组，返回实际会选择的具体组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slot_avail </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    slot_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(substitute_group, slot_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> grp,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(available_qty) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avail</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory_available i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bundle_slot_candidate c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">component_sku</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bundle_sku</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :bundleSku </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :ver</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FLOOR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(avail </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> demand_qty)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bundle_available</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slot_avail </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bundle_slot s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (slot_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"告知义务\">告知义务</h3><p>替代降级的合规边界很简单：<strong>买家看到的组合描述里承诺了什么，就必须交付什么</strong>。若组合标题写了具体型号而实际发替代品，即使功能等价也构成货不对板。工程上的做法是在可售性合成返回替代结果时，同时返回一个 <code>substitution_notice</code> 字段，由前台在结算前展示。这也是本 hub <a href=\"../bundle-merchandising/bundle-return-component-recovery\">Bundle 退货按组件回收与退款分摊</a> 中「退货理由是替代品不匹配」这一类争议的防线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预留一致性与并发\">预留一致性与并发</h2><p>可售性合成是<strong>读</strong>，下单是<strong>写</strong>，两者之间必须有一致性保障。经典错误是先查可售性、再逐组件预留，两步之间组件被其它订单抢走，导致组合下单成功但组件预留失败。</p>\n<p>处理方式有两种，各有明确取舍：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>悲观锁</strong>：按组件 SKU 排序后依次加行锁，在锁内完成合成与预留。简单可靠，但组合涉及多个 SKU 时锁持有时间长，高并发下容易成为瓶颈。</li>\n<li><strong>乐观预留 + 补偿</strong>：先预留全部组件（任一步失败则回滚已预留的部分），把可售性合成当作预留失败时的重试判断依据。吞吐更好，但需要严格保证补偿的幂等。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>无论选哪种，有一条不变量必须守住：<strong>订单里记录的组件预留总量，必须等于该订单所有组合行的组件需求之和</strong>。这条不变量是盘点差异与「超卖」争议的最终裁决依据，应当在高并发压测中专门验证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"降级而非下架\">降级而非下架</h3><p>当组合不可售时，前台的正确反应通常不是直接下架，而是<strong>降级展示</strong>：动态捆绑隐藏缺货槽位的选项、固定套装提示「部分组件缺货，可单独购买」、买赠在赠品不足时自动停止赠品而不是整单拒绝。降级的判断依据正是本节的四层合成结果——它应当返回「哪些槽位不可满足」，而不只是一个布尔值。这项设计要求会反向影响 <a href=\"../bundle-merchandising/bundle-pdp-cart-recommendation\">商详/购物车/搜索的 Bundle 呈现</a> 的接口形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见合成错误\">常见合成错误</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>修法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>槽位内候选取最大值而非求和</td>\n<td>有替代候选时低估可售量</td>\n<td>求和后按需求量整除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>忽略多件槽位的整除</td>\n<td>需求 2 件、库存 3 件时给出可售 3</td>\n<td>取下界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨槽共享 SKU 不建模互斥</td>\n<td>扣减数量翻倍，实际超卖</td>\n<td>用 <code>exclusiveWith</code> 显式声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可选槽位计入可售性上限</td>\n<td>无货的可选项导致整组合下架</td>\n<td>可选槽位只影响展示与价格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>替代在拣货时决定</td>\n<td>分摊与报关要素需事后追改</td>\n<td>在可售性查询阶段完成替换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"接口形态的最小要求\">接口形态的最小要求</h2><p>可售性接口不应只返回一个布尔或一个数字，至少需要返回三项，否则前台无法做降级展示：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>bundle_available</code>：组合可售数量。</li>\n<li><code>unsatisfiable_slots</code>：当前不可满足的槽位列表（供降级而非下架使用）。</li>\n<li><code>substitution_notice</code>：发生的替代降级说明（供结算前告知买家）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三项的最小集决定了 <a href=\"../bundle-merchandising/bundle-pdp-cart-recommendation\">商详/购物车/搜索的 Bundle 呈现</a> 中价格展示与缺货提示能否做对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>组合可售量是各必选槽位可满足量的最小值，槽位内候选求和、多件槽位整除后取下界。</li>\n<li>跨槽共享 SKU 会重复计数，必须用互斥约束显式建模。</li>\n<li>替代降级须在可售性查询阶段完成并写入订单行，且必须对买家可见。</li>\n<li>可售性合成与预留之间需一致性保障，悲观锁或乐观预留 + 补偿各有取舍。</li>\n<li>不可售时应降级展示而非整组合下架，接口需返回不可满足的槽位信息。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>组合能卖之后的问题是如何分钱到组件，见 <a href=\"bundle-price-allocation-component\">Bundle 价格/折扣在组件上的分摊</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"组件可售性、缺货与替代","id":"组件可售性-缺货与替代"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"最小值的直觉与陷阱","id":"最小值的直觉与陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"替代降级的边界条件","id":"替代降级的边界条件"},{"level":3,"text":"降级的实现与告知","id":"降级的实现与告知"},{"level":3,"text":"告知义务","id":"告知义务"},{"level":2,"text":"预留一致性与并发","id":"预留一致性与并发"},{"level":3,"text":"降级而非下架","id":"降级而非下架"},{"level":2,"text":"常见合成错误","id":"常见合成错误"},{"level":2,"text":"接口形态的最小要求","id":"接口形态的最小要求"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Bundle SKU 与组件主数据映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dynamic-bundle-kit-commerce/bundle-model/bundle-sku-component-masterdata"},"next":{"title":"Bundle 价格与折扣在组件上的分摊","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dynamic-bundle-kit-commerce/bundle-inventory-price/bundle-price-allocation-component"}}